<cl=A2A2A2>
Sorcerers are the only magicians of the Sphere capable of endowing objects with magical properties.
The nature of this magic is alchemical, so sorcerers do not know the magic of the elements well. Sorcerers possess
unique resistance to attacks of any property - physical or magical.
Working with alchemical components and formulas leaves them no time to improve
combat skills. Those who are too fond of them and have already managed to get any serious
the title, the Sorcerers consider to be ignorant and not allowed to the knowledge of the Guild. Wizards
they care a lot about the reputation of the guild, so they don't take on questionable items
origin. Only weapons with the brand of the guild of Armorers or armor with a brand
Kuznetsov are worthy of their attention. The sorcerers have penetrated the secrets of the armor so well that
acquired the ability to influence them from a distance. Spells Tornado and Rusty
Armor can, if not change the course of the battle, then at least give the Wizard time
hide.
